OL,3,AGCSE grade gap between boys and girls
OL,4,Ashrinks to lowest since 2000, as
OL,5,Astudents open their results
OL,6,
OL,7,FChildhood best friends Jessie and Ellie
OL,8,Fare relieved with their grades and have
OL,9,Fthanked their "amazing teacher, Miss
OL,10,FEvie", while it's confetti, cheers and
OL,11,Fhappy tears at one school in Derby
OL,13,FAspiring dancer Finn "can't believe"
OL,14,Fhe's "passed everything", but not
OL,15,Feveryone getting their results is a
OL,16,Fteenager, as 52-year-old grandmother
OL,17,FWynne is "shocked" but "very happy" to
OL,18,Fhave passed her maths exam
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
