OL,3,AMushroom killer must stay in jail
OL,4,Aforever for 'truly dreadful' crime,
OL,5,Aappeal court told
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe 51-year-old, who attended the Court
OL,8,Fof Appeal via video link from prison,
OL,9,Fwill be eligible to be freed after 33
OL,10,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
